@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@ownerToken = replace-with-owner-admin-token
@tenantToken = replace-with-tenant-token
@ownerOrganizationId = replace-with-owning-organization-id
@propertyId = replace-with-property-id
@applicationId = replace-with-approved-application-id
@applicationVersion = 3
@leaseId = replace-with-lease-id
@leaseVersion = 0
@revisionId = replace-with-current-revision-id
@documentHash = replace-with-current-revision-sha256
@terminationId = replace-with-termination-request-id
@proposalHash = replace-with-termination-proposal-sha256
@ownerDisplayName = Your account display name
@tenantLegalName = Your name in the agreement
@startDate = 2026-10-15
@endDate = 2027-10-14
@proposedEndDate = 2026-10-15

# Set ownerPassword and tenantPassword in the HTTP client's PRIVATE environment.
# These are application login passwords, not the PostgreSQL password.
# Update dates and versions before each request. Start today to try activation locally.

### Create a private draft from a currently APPROVED application
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId":"{{applicationId}}","applicationVersion":{{applicationVersion}},"terms":{"title":"Residential agreement","startDate":"{{startDate}}","endDate":"{{endDate}}","monthlyRent":"25000.00","deposit":"50000.00","currency":"KES","rentDueDay":5,"agreementText":"Replace this with your negotiated agreement text before sending."}}

### Management detail; refresh leaseVersion, revisionId, and documentHash from this response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Draft revision; only DRAFT is editable, and this appends a new immutable revision
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"terms":{"title":"Residential agreement","startDate":"{{startDate}}","endDate":"{{endDate}}","monthlyRent":"25000.00","deposit":"50000.00","currency":"KES","rentDueDay":5,"agreementText":"Replace this with the revised negotiated agreement text."}}

### Send the current draft for tenant review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}}}

### Tenant detail; only shared documents are visible here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Download and review the exact UTF-8 bytes whose SHA-256 is documentHash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/revisions/{{revisionId}}/document
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant signs this revision; password comes from the private environment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","evidence":{"documentHash":"{{documentHash}}","typedName":"{{tenantLegalName}}","password":"{{tenantPassword}}","consent":true}}

### Owner representative signs; use the current version after the tenant signed (either order works)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"revisionId":"{{revisionId}}","evidence":{"documentHash":"{{documentHash}}","typedName":"{{ownerDisplayName}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}","consent":true}}

### Execution receipt requires both parties to have signed the same revision
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/revisions/{{revisionId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Alternate unsigned path: recall to a fresh draft; all old signatures stay with the old revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/recall
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"Please review revised terms before signing again."}

### Alternate unsigned path: tenant declines the SENT agreement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"Please prepare different terms."}

### Alternate unsigned path: manager cancels; application reservation remains until separately resolved
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"This draft will be replaced."}

### Activate a SIGNED lease during its term after confirming move-in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"possessionConfirmed":true}

### Tenant previews a proposed early termination; record returned proposalHash
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"proposedEndDate":"{{proposedEndDate}}","message":"Please end the lease by mutual agreement."}

### Tenant consents to that exact proposal; this creates a PENDING request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"proposedEndDate":"{{proposedEndDate}}","message":"Please end the lease by mutual agreement.","evidence":{"documentHash":"{{proposalHash}}","typedName":"{{tenantLegalName}}","password":"{{tenantPassword}}","consent":true}}

### Owner downloads the proposal before providing the other party's consent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations/{{terminationId}}/document
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner accepts; this changes the effective end date but does not release the unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations/{{terminationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"evidence":{"documentHash":"{{proposalHash}}","typedName":"{{ownerDisplayName}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}","consent":true}}

### Alternative: the other party rejects a pending proposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations/{{terminationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"Please propose another end date."}

### Alternative: the original requester cancels their pending proposal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations/{{terminationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"Withdrawing my proposal."}

### Close on/after the natural or mutually accepted end date; unit becomes UNAVAILABLE for checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"message":"The agreed end date has arrived; checkout is pending."}

### Only after checking vacancy, release the unit to AVAILABLE; no automatic listing publication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/{{leaseId}}/release-unit
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{leaseVersion}},"vacancyConfirmed":true,"message":"Inspection confirms that the unit is vacant."}

### Tenant history and shared revisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/history?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Shared revision metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Termination proposal history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/{{leaseId}}/terminations
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/leases/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Business dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{ownerOrganizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/leases/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Existing inbox includes application notifications and new lease URLs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
